## Recipe 1 — Milk Bread (from the manual, p.18)

| Ingredient | Amount |
|---|---|
| Water | 1/4 cup |
| Milk | 1/2 cup |
| Egg | 1 large |
| Bread flour | 2-1/4 cups |
| All-purpose flour | 2 Tbsp |
| Sugar | 1-1/2 Tbsp |
| Salt | 1 tsp |
| Butter | 2-1/3 Tbsp |
| Active dry yeast | 1 tsp |

Optional: crack the egg into the measured water and milk and give it a quick whisk.

